100 REM MOVING SPRITES -- X16 BASIC, VERA
110 REM ONE 16X16 SHAPE, 8 BITS A PIXEL, POKED INTO VRAM AT $1:3000;
120 REM 16 SPRITES SHARE IT.  100 MOVES OF ALL 16 (1600 MOVSPR), TIMED.
130 PRINT "16 SPRITES, 100 MOVES EACH, X16 BASIC"
140 FOR I=0 TO 255:VPOKE 1,12288+I,16+(I AND 15):NEXT
150 FOR N=0 TO 15
160 SPRMEM N,1,12288,1
170 SPRITE N,3,0,0,1,1,1
180 NEXT
200 T=TI
210 FOR F=0 TO 99
220 FOR N=0 TO 15
230 MOVSPR N,20+F*2+N*8,100+N*4
240 NEXT:NEXT
250 T=TI-T
260 POKE 40885,2:REM $9FB5: RECORD A FEW GIF FRAMES FOR THE RECORD
262 T=TI
264 IF TI-T<20 THEN 264
266 POKE 40885,0
270 FOR N=0 TO 15:SPRITE N,0:NEXT
300 PRINT "RESULT SPRITES";T/60;"S"
310 PRINT "DONE"
